                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true'>Unique Delivery Addresses (%)</run>
                <run>Æ </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>is the </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>% of first orders with a voucher that go to an address that didn&apos;t have delivery before.</run>
