            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip show-buttons='false'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Introduction:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>This tab shows main KPIs to evaluate NCI Fraud Service performance. All metrics are calculated for the first orders with vouchers.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Explanation:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true'>Vouchers Redeemed (€)</run>
                <run> is amount in euros spent while customers redeem vouchers for the first orders.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true'>Vouchers Blocked (€)</run>
                <run> is amount in euros blocked while customers redeem vouchers for the first orders. Whenever a customer tries to redeem a voucher multiple times, we calculate it as a single attempt block amount.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>False Positives</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>Æ </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>are defined as orders placed without voucher after block over the next 28 days.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>False Negatives</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> are calculated by post-order automated labeling which takes into account customer behaviour after a first order.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>Churn</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> is a proxy metric for fraudulent voucher redemption. Churn is defined as no orders after a customer&apos;s first order over the next 28 days.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Known Limitations:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>False Positives and Churn Rate charts are 28 days lagged.</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
