                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>Confusion Matrix: A matrix to compare the system’s classification of fraud vs the observed &quot;truth” to measure the accuracy of the classification. The observed “truth” is based on the user behavior post the voucher request</run>
