                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>Recall: [TP/TP+FN] - % of fraud detected among total potential fraud in the system</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>TP: Voucher acquisitions correctly blocked</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>FP: Voucher acquisitions incorrectly blocked</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>FN: Voucher acquistions incorrectly passed</run>
